d 'WORDFREQ': module to provide Bilingual (Chinese/English) keyword-frequency statistics for PDF report corpora and for text already held in memory
d
d	 wordfreq counts how often each of a set of user-supplied
d keywords occurs in a corpus of documents and returns one   
d word-frequency variable per keyword, together with a
d total-frequency variable.  Both Chinese and English are
d supported. 
d
d KW: text processing
d KW: frequencies
d
d Requires: Stata version 16
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261010
d
d Author: Wu LiangHai,  Anhui University of Technology
d Support: email agd2010@@yeah.net
d
d Author:   Wu Hanyan, Nanjing University of Aeronautics and Astronautics
d Support: email    2325476320@@qq.com
d
d Author:    Xu Huihui  ,  Anhui University of Technology
d Support: email  2847844621@@qq.com         
d
f wordfreq.ado
f wordfreq_pdf.py
f wordfreq.sthlp
